        sh:node nltl:I2_004_UpperIceWaterlineCaseShape ;
        sh:severity sh:Violation ;
        sh:message "Each admitted ship must have at least one upper ice waterline case." ;
    ]","insertion_context":null,"reason":"The supplied mapping establishes that hasUpperIceWaterlineCase points to upperIceWaterlineCase, but it does not establish that the represented cases are the complete set of waterlines used for determining the UIWL. The candidate therefore cannot be confirmed to select the greatest displacement over the full source-relevant set. This is a material representation-adequacy question distinct from the confirmed one-sided comparison error.","expected":"The represented case collection must be established as the complete set of waterlines used for determining the UIWL before the greatest displacement is selected.","suggestion":"Provide an explicit supplied completeness convention for hasUpperIceWaterlineCase, or supply a schema-supported path or constraint establishing that the case collection is exhaustive. Do not infer completeness from the RDFS domain or range.","evidence_excerpt":"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#hasUpperIceWaterlineCase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#upperIceWaterlineCase> .","change_id":null,"property":"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#hasUpperIceWaterlineCase","proposed_unit":null,"proposed_datatype":null,"proposed_path":["https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#hasUpperIceWaterlineCase","https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#waterlineCaseDisplacement"]}],"change_assessments":[],"reconciliations":[{"issue_id":"I2-004-LOGIC-001","state":"PERSISTENT","source_excerpt":"I2.1.2.2 The ship displacement DUI is the displacement, in kt, of the ship corresponding to the
            upper ice waterline (UIWL). Where multiple waterlines are used for determining the UIWL, the
            displacement is to be determined from the waterline corresponding to the greatest
            displacement.","candidate_excerpt":"                    FILTER (?caseValue > ?upperValue)","insertion_context":null,"reason":"The candidate still rejects only when a represented case is greater than DUI. It does not require numeric equality between DUI and the greatest represented case displacement, so the previously identified logic error remains."},{"issue_id":"I2-004-CONTEXT-001","state":"PERSISTENT","source_excerpt":"Where multiple waterlines are used for determining the UIWL, the
            displacement is to be determined from the waterline corresponding to the greatest
            displacement.","candidate_excerpt":"        sh:path nltl:hasUpperIceWaterlineCase ;
        sh:minCount 1 ;
        sh:node nltl:I2_004_UpperIceWaterlineCaseShape ;","insertion_context":null,"reason":"The candidate still requires at least one case but supplies no explicit completeness convention establishing that all waterlines used to determine the UIWL are represented by hasUpperIceWaterlineCase. The supplied range mapping alone does not resolve this material representation question."}],"unchecked":[{"scope":"aa7a4df3cc909127170fa72b3879ac21512fb45065a8e41b8fecdbf15060caca","material":false,"reason":"The omitted passage is outside the supplied I2.1.2.2 text needed to identify the greatest-displacement obligation; broader UR I2 effects were not assessed."},{"scope":"fb42052bcee201b71dea09ac424e8f3157fdf41f16080fc68776c6bd1a4f5bf4","material":false,"reason":"The omitted passage is outside the supplied I2.1.2.2 text needed for this review."},{"scope":"4f2104b852857e63498fdeb8d7b9047cbcd5988fb783ff134a89a1aa4fda61d4","material":false,"reason":"The omitted introductory passages are outside the supplied requirement clause and were not needed to assess the displacement-selection obligation."},{"scope":"430aaaa772843afc07a12ff9d2269fb81f288142f6c1eed76f59fb0658f46a3e","material":false,"reason":"The omitted passage is outside the supplied requirement clause and no dependency on it is asserted by the candidate."},{"scope":"25867fdf103c32cdbf9a29aecddb5b52617d8b305af51697261e4ae1b6d364dc","material":false,"reason":"The omitted passage is outside I2.1.2.2; external population and edition context are caller-admitted rather than independently inferred here."},{"scope":"7af439e2a51193e41a8a56100e56dc9829ad0a1980e549838a9747fe453df9bc","material":false,"reason":"UR F0 is not cited by the supplied requirement or candidate and was outside this clause review."},{"scope":"eeb8981c183fafd8c40cbd6a5fc4104958da9c00f52c3423b3e0118c744dfb6d","material":false,"reason":"The omitted later I2 passage is outside I2.1.2.2 and is not used by the candidate's displacement logic."},{"scope":"e90a8fba9b5f